  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Huvudm&#xe5;let med insatsen var att f&#xf6;rb&#xe4;ttra livsmedelsf&#xf6;rs&#xf6;rjningen f&#xf6;r utsatta hush&#xe5;ll genom varierad jordbruksassistans. M&#xe5;lgruppen f&#xf6;r     insatsen inkluderar &#xe5;terv&#xe4;ndande flyktingar samt hush&#xe5;ll ledda av     kvinnor och f&#xf6;r&#xe4;ldral&#xf6;sa ungdomar</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The main objective of the project was to improve the food security of affected households through agricultural assistance. The target group included returning refugees, female headed households and orphans.</narrative>
